<div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><h2 class="h3">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Analyst EPS Estimates</h2><table class="scroll-table sort-table" id="earnings-estimates"><thead><tr><th data-sort="int">Quarter</th><th data-sort="float">Number of Estimates</th><th data-sort="float">Low Estimate</th><th data-sort="float">High Estimate</th><th data-sort="float">Average Estimate</th><th data-sort="float">Company Guidance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-sort-value="20231">Q1 2023</td><td>1</td><td>$1.23</td><td>$1.23</td><td>$1.23</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20232">Q2 2023</td><td>1</td><td>$1.08</td><td>$1.08</td><td>$1.08</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20233">Q3 2023</td><td>1</td><td>$1.13</td><td>$1.13</td><td>$1.13</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20234">Q4 2023</td><td>1</td><td>$1.33</td><td>$1.33</td><td>$1.33</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr style="background:#f4ece9;"><td><strong>FY 2023</strong></td><td>4</td><td>$4.77</td><td>$4.77</td><td>$4.77</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20241">Q1 2024</td><td>1</td><td>$1.17</td><td>$1.17</td><td>$1.17</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20242">Q2 2024</td><td>1</td><td>$1.24</td><td>$1.24</td><td>$1.24</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20243">Q3 2024</td><td>1</td><td>$1.64</td><td>$1.64</td><td>$1.64</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20244">Q4 2024</td><td>1</td><td>$1.77</td><td>$1.77</td><td>$1.77</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr style="background:#f4ece9;"><td><strong>FY 2024</strong></td><td>4</td><td>$5.82</td><td>$5.82</td><td>$5.82</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20251">Q1 2025</td><td>1</td><td>$1.49</td><td>$1.49</td><td>$1.49</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20252">Q2 2025</td><td>1</td><td>$1.56</td><td>$1.56</td><td>$1.56</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td data-sort-value="20253">Q3 2025</td><td>1</td><td>$2.06</td><td>$2.06</td><td>$2.06</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="col-lg-5 mt-3 mt-lg-5"><div class="shadow bg-white"><h2 class="block-header-blue white-shadow m-0 h3">TSM Earnings Date and Information</h2><div class="d-flex w-100 flex-wrap p-3 lh-medium position-relative"><div class="read-more-section"><p class="mb-0">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing last released its quarterly earnings data on October 19th, 2023. The semiconductor company reported $1.29 earnings per share for the quarter, topping the consensus estimate of $1.16 by $0.13. The company had revenue of $17.28 billion for the quarter, compared to analyst estimates of $16.90 billion. Its revenue was down 10.1% on a year-over-year basis. Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing has generated $5.56 earnings per share over the last year ($5.56 diluted earnings per share) and currently has a price-to-earnings ratio of 18.0. Earnings for Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing are expected to grow by 16.70% in the coming year, from $4.97 to $5.80 per share. Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing has not formally confirmed its next earnings publication date, but the company's estimated earnings date is Thursday, January 11th, 2024 based off prior year's report dates.</p></div><div class="c-blue read-more-button invisible">Read More <span class="mb-icon icon-arrow" style="transform:rotate(90deg) scale(.9)"></span></div></div></div></div></div>
