<div class="row mt-5"><div class="d-md-none w-100 text-center"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width:90px;max-width:70%;" width="90" height="88" src="/images/faq.svg" alt class="m-auto pb-3"></div><div class="d-none d-md-block col-md-2  text-center"><div style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;overflow:hidden;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width:150px;max-width:70%;" width="150" height="147" src="/images/faq.svg" alt class="m-auto pb-3"><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span><br><span class="mb-icon icon-line-element-repeating c-light-gray"></span></div></div><div class="lh-medium col-md-10" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage"><h2 class="mt-0 mb-4">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Earnings - Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><dl><div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question1" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">When is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings date?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer1">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing has not confirmed its next earnings publication date, but the company's estimated earnings date is Thursday, January 11th, 2024 based off last year's report dates. <a href="/stocks/NYSE/TSM/earnings/" class="sr-only sr-only-focusable">Learn more on TSM's earnings history.</a></p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question2" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">Did Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing beat their earnings estimates last quarter?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer2">In the previous quarter, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) reported $1.29 earnings per share (EPS) to beat the analysts' consensus estimate of $1.16 by $0.13. <a href="/stocks/NYSE/TSM/earnings/" class="sr-only sr-only-focusable">Learn more on analysts' earnings estimate vs. TSM's actual earnings.</a></p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question3" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">How can I listen to Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings conference call?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer3">The conference call for Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's latest earnings report can be listened to online. <a href="http://mmm.wallstreethorizon.com/u.asp?u=511028" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Listen to Conference Call for Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing" class="d-block">Listen to Conference Call<span class="mb-icon icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question4" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">How can I read Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's conference call transcript?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer4">The conference call transcript for Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's latest earnings report can be read online. <a href="https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/19/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q3-2023-ear/?source=wsh-transcript&utm_source=wsh-transcript&utm_medium=feed&utm_campaign=article" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Read Conference Call Transcript for Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing" class="d-block">Read Transcript<span class="mb-icon icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p>
</div></dd>
</div>
</dl></div><div class="col-lg-6"><dl><div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question5" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">How much revenue does Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing generate each year?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer5">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a recorded annual revenue of $75.88 billion.</p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question6" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">How much profit does Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing generate each year?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer6">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a recorded net income of $32.31 billion. TSM has generated $5.56 earnings per share over the last four quarters. </p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question7" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">What is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's price-to-earnings ratio?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer7">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a trailing price-to-earnings ratio of 18.05 and a forward price-to-earnings ratio of 20.19. The price/earnings-to-growth ratio is 2.82.</p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question8" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">What is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's EPS forecast for next year?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-gold pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-gold">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer8">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings are expected to grow from $4.97 per share to $5.80 per share in the next year, which is a 16.70% increase.</p>
</div></dd>
</div>
</dl></div></div></div>
</div>
